// E1103: `version` must be `major.minor.patch`; `a.b.c` has parts that are not numbers, so it is reported at the value
// (§15.3 `version` row, §14.3, §18.1; S-580).

@export
pub flow voice(x: F32 at sample) -> F32 at sample { x }
